WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:08.440
Shanks, Mihawk, Roger. All three characters are&nbsp;
some of the most powerful in all of One Piece,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:16.720
and they all have one thing in common. NO. DEVIL.&nbsp;
FRUITS. Of course they have unbelievable haki and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:22.720
sword skills, but that’s not the point of this&nbsp;
video! Because I want to take these already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:30.040
insanely overpowered characters and make them&nbsp;
absolutely untouchable by finding THE ABSOLUTELY&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:35.320
PERFECT devil fruits for all the Strongest&nbsp;
Non-Devil Fruit users in the entire story.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:41.240
And we’re going to kick this off with possibly&nbsp;
the STRONGEST CHARACTER EVER! And yes, I’m of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:48.240
course talking about the former pirate king,&nbsp;
Gol D. Roger, who mostly overwhelmed his foes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:57.080
with his god-tier haki, supreme swordsmanship, and&nbsp;
possibly the greatest crew to ever sail the seas.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:04.160
But what he NEVER HAD, as far as we know&nbsp;
as least, is a broken devil fruit ability.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.440
And I’ll be honest, when thinking about&nbsp;
the perfect devil fruit for Roger,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:14.040
the first fruit that came to mind was his&nbsp;
son’s devil fruit, the Flame-Flame fruit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:19.800
That’s because this Logia power is just SO&nbsp;
OP as it allows you to literally shoot out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:25.520
flames, create giant waves of fire, and&nbsp;
especially for a swordsman like Roger,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:33.640
you can coat your blade in flames to cut&nbsp;
down enemies with devastating fiery slashes.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:39.680
However, when actually thinking about it,&nbsp;
there is one devil fruit that would meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:47.920
Roger’s needs even better than the Flame fruit.&nbsp;
And that is of course the Nika devil fruit that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:58.080
was eaten by Luffy. And for the longest time&nbsp;
fans thought that Roger might have already&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:01.760
eaten this fruit, but we don’t know for sure.&nbsp;
However, since we now know that awakening this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:09.000
fruit allows you to become the legendary figure&nbsp;
Joy Boy, then we just HAVE TO give it to Roger.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:16.200
That’s because when Roger and his crew finally&nbsp;
reached Laugh Tale, for some unknown reason they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:22.240
were too early to use what they found there.&nbsp;
Now that could simply have been a time thing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:27.000
like they didn’t show up at the right time, or&nbsp;
it might have been because they needed Joy Boy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:34.000
to awaken in order to use the secret treasures&nbsp;
left by the Ancient Kingdom. We had some hint&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:40.600
of this when Shanks decided to go after the&nbsp;
One Piece after he learned Luffy had awakened,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:47.560
so giving Roger this fruit just makes too much&nbsp;
sense if it means he could have actually used&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:57.640
what he found on Laugh Tale. Plus, his personality&nbsp;
is so similar to Luffy’s that I’m sure he would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.640 --> 00:03:03.240
have eventually awakened this fruit and&nbsp;
made full use of its broken abilities.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:09.760
Now that Roger has his fruit though, we need&nbsp;
one for his right hand man, Rayleigh. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:17.480
the so-called Dark King fights in basically the&nbsp;
exact same way as his captain BUT I have a VERY&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:24.240
DIFFERENT devil fruit in mind for Luffy’s mentor.&nbsp;
That’s because Rayleigh has almost unmatched speed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:31.960
and power, but we could turn his stats all the&nbsp;
way up to max by giving him the Light Devil fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:37.400
which would allow him to move at light speeds,&nbsp;
swing his sword with even more devastating power,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:42.920
and of course shoot off light bullets to take&nbsp;
out enemies from a distance. And Rayleigh has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:50.000
been linked to this fruit ever since he clashed&nbsp;
with admiral Kizaru during the Sabaody arc,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.960
but even though this fruit would&nbsp;
be PERFECT for the Dark King,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:59.680
I’m actually thinking another fruit might be&nbsp;
better for Rayleigh during his prime years.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:06.640
Because we know he was already a top tier&nbsp;
fighter, but one thing he couldn’t ever do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:13.680
is help his captain stay alive once Roger got a&nbsp;
deadly disease. So what if we gave Rayleigh the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:18.400
Phoenix devil fruit because of its special&nbsp;
healing abilities? And in case you forgot,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:24.240
this fruit is a mythical zoan that turns the&nbsp;
user into this majestic blue Phoenix that can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:31.600
fly around. But the UNBELIEVABLE special ability&nbsp;
of this fruit is to use these magical blue flames&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:40.920
to heal yourself and others. So what if by having&nbsp;
this ability Rayleigh could have actually cured&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:47.200
Roger, or if not that then maybe extend his&nbsp;
lifespan by giving him a regular supply of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:54.200
healing flames. Plus I just think the idea of&nbsp;
a flying swordsman is just incredibly awesome,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:58.480
so I’m giving this fruit to Rayleigh.&nbsp;
But as hard as it is to believe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:05.360
Roger and Rayleigh are not even the strongest&nbsp;
members of their own crew in this video. That’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:10.760
because we’ll be giving the perfect devil&nbsp;
fruit to Shanks in just a few minutes.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:17.440
But before we get to the Red Haired Emperor we&nbsp;
first need to talk about the man who used to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:25.200
hunt down the Roger Pirates, Monkey D. Garp. And&nbsp;
unlike Roger and Rayleigh, Luffy’s Grandpa is just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:30.560
a straight up brawler who fights with his bare&nbsp;
knuckle fists. However, if you know anything about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:38.240
the old man you’ll know those fists are basically&nbsp;
nuclear weapons as he can wipe out entire cities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:47.920
with a single punch. So we of course have to ask,&nbsp;
what is the perfect devil fruit to give a man such&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:55.560
powerful punches? Well, first I was thinking that&nbsp;
the Buddha fruit, which was eaten by his friend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.560 --> 00:06:01.280
and former fleet admiral, makes a ton of sense.&nbsp;
That’s because eating this fruit would allow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:07.000
Garp to transform into an enormous golden Buddha&nbsp;
with giant fists and the ability to send out huge&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:15.760
shockwaves. But I am a bit concerned this would&nbsp;
slow Garp down. Plus that giant body might make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:22.080
Garp extra hungry, so our next contender here&nbsp;
is the Biscuit Fruit, which would allow him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:26.640
make an endless supply of delicious biscuits.&nbsp;
Because as we know, one of Garp’s favorite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:32.520
foods is Rice Crackers, which I think he’d be&nbsp;
able to make with this devil fruit as well.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:40.600
And while that would certainly satisfy his hunger&nbsp;
cravings, it still isn’t quite the most impressive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:46.480
fruit for Garp, so let’s give him the classic&nbsp;
Luffy treatment, where we take his punches and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:54.720
just make them bigger. And we can do that with the&nbsp;
Deka Deka no mi, which as we see right here allows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.720 --> 00:07:01.440
its user to freely change their size to make them&nbsp;
into enormous humans that are literally the size&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:06.920
of mountains. And while we earlier mentioned that&nbsp;
Garp being bigger was a bad thing since it would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:13.040
make him slower, I’d like to think that he could&nbsp;
keep his normal form for speed and then change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:21.160
his size right before punching someone to create&nbsp;
a MASSIVE impact. Which means if he can normally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:30.720
destroy entire cities, then with this power he&nbsp;
might even be able to wipe out entire islands.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:35.960
If we’re thinking about it though, Garp’s&nbsp;
apprentice Koby might someday surpass the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:42.560
legendary marine, and to do that he might just&nbsp;
need the perfect devil fruit. And lucky for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:50.880
Pink haired marine, we are here to help! And these&nbsp;
options are just going to absolutely blow your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:58.720
mind. Let’s kick it off by considering the Ice&nbsp;
Devil fruit, which was eaten by the former admiral&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:04.240
Aokiji. And ever since Aokiji left the marines&nbsp;
there has always been a chance he would die,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:09.840
which means that Koby could in fact eat this&nbsp;
fruit sometime in the future. But like most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:14.160
Logia’s it is just absurdly powerful,&nbsp;
with the ability to freeze anything,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:20.200
shoot out icy blasts, and even create ice&nbsp;
weapons to use against opponents. What makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:25.480
this fruit truly perfect for Koby though&nbsp;
is that we recently learned that Aokiji was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:32.040
ALSO a beloved student of Garp, so there is&nbsp;
some history to go with this fruit and Koby.

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:37.720
But if we’re being honest, Koby is more&nbsp;
of a fistfighter just like his mentor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:42.520
so let’s think of a fruit that will go with his&nbsp;
normal fighting style. And this is going to blow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:48.440
your mind because with Koby’s expert levels&nbsp;
of haki and destructive punches, he is most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:54.280
comfortable fighting at close range. But with many&nbsp;
devil fruit users who can fight from far away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.280 --> 00:09:00.960
Koby might be at a disadvantage in many fights.&nbsp;
So to fix that let’s give him the ONLY DEVIL&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:06.240
FRUIT that can make sure you have close range&nbsp;
combat against other devil fruit users, which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:12.680
is actually the Darkness Logia fruit, originally&nbsp;
eaten by Blackbeard. Which sounds crazy, I know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:20.320
but let me explain why. We all know Blackbeard’s&nbsp;
powers allow him to shoot out darkness and trap&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:27.520
people in to his black hole, but one of his&nbsp;
other abilities allows him to suck in devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:32.920
fruit users so he can touch them and erase&nbsp;
their devil fruit ability. And once he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:37.680
hold of them he can beat them down, so if we gave&nbsp;
this same power to Koby, he would always be able&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:43.280
to fight devil fruit users at close range&nbsp;
and deal massive blows like this. So yeah,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:50.320
this power alone would make Koby one of the&nbsp;
most feared fighters in the entire world.

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:58.200
However, you can already describe this next&nbsp;
character that way because Dracule Mihawk is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:07.360
the World’s Strongest Swordsman. And while we’ve&nbsp;
never actually seen him fight all out, we can just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:14.440
imagine that he has top-tier haki to match his&nbsp;
insane sword skills, since he was said to fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:20.600
on par with Shanks back in their early days. Which&nbsp;
means he obviously doesn’t need a devil fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:26.080
but just like Koby, Mihawk’s fighting style&nbsp;
could also be enhanced by the Darkness fruit’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:33.280
abilities. For example, he could use his darkness&nbsp;
pocket dimension to store different swords and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:39.080
pull them out when he needs them. Or he could use&nbsp;
it the same way we discussed with Koby, but since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:47.000
Mihawk can send flying slashes, he doesn’t need&nbsp;
the ability to suck people in like Koby does.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:56.600
What he does need though, is this! Because&nbsp;
come on, who wouldn’t have to see a winged&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.600 --> 00:11:02.440
version of this dark swordsman flying around&nbsp;
and chasing down his enemies? And if we’re&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:07.680
talking about a fruit with wings, then&nbsp;
probably the best one for Mihawk would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:13.480
be the Falcon fruit which was once eaten&nbsp;
by this Alabasta royal guard. And I know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:17.640
it’s not exactly the same as his name, I&nbsp;
did extra research to see if there was a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:22.120
Hawk fruit to fit Mihawk’s name, but the&nbsp;
Falcon fruit is the closest I could find.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:30.480
Speaking of Swordsmen though, this next one&nbsp;
is different from EVERY OTHER SWORDSMAN here&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:37.200
because Oden Kozuki’s two sword style was nearly&nbsp;
strong enough to take down the Emperor Kaido. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:43.000
while his haki levels are a tier below those&nbsp;
of Roger and the other top tiers on this list,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:48.920
Oden is still an extremely powerful fighter&nbsp;
who could possibly reach the top with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:57.760
help of the perfect devil fruit. Now, picking&nbsp;
the perfect fruit for Oden is tough. Obviously,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.760 --> 00:12:04.320
any Logia would be a boost to his overall defense&nbsp;
and power, but based on his personality I think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:10.280
a hilarious option would once again&nbsp;
be the Buddha fruit. I mean, come on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:16.600
Oden just seems like a guy who would love to walk&nbsp;
around as a giant golden Buddha. But the option&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:23.880
that BEST balances power, defense, and Oden’s&nbsp;
sword style is actually the Heat Heat fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:29.200
originally eaten by one of Big Mom’s children.&nbsp;
And I know this sounds like some kind of sick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:35.720
joke since Oden was literally boiled to death, but&nbsp;
with the powers of the Heat Fruit, Oden might be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:41.320
resistant to such high temperatures meaning that&nbsp;
this fruit gives him a great chance to survive the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:46.240
boiling. On top of that, he could send out&nbsp;
MASSIVE heat waves, set people on fire, or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:52.520
even add flaming heat to his impressive two-sword&nbsp;
style of fighting, just like this guy right here.

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:59.040
Now with Oden’s new blazing swords out of the&nbsp;
way, we can finally talk about the only Straw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:05.200
Hat on this list. And while I’ve already done full&nbsp;
length videos on Zoro and Sanji’s perfect fruits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:13.880
I also think the Straw Hat’s helmsman, Jinbe, is a&nbsp;
perfect candidate for a devil fruit boost. I mean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:19.680
he’s already a powerful fighter with his mastery&nbsp;
of fishman karate and his ability to manipulate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:26.320
water somewhat, so obviously something water or&nbsp;
ice-related would be perfect for him. Something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:31.840
like the Ice Devil fruit would fit nicely with&nbsp;
his powers as he could move water around and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:31.840 --> 00:13:37.240
then freeze it at the perfect time. Another&nbsp;
water related ability is the Swim Swim fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:44.720
which we now know that Jinbe’s clone possesses,&nbsp;
so this would obviously be a good option as well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:52.600
However, I’m actually going to go in the&nbsp;
complete opposite direction now because I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:52.600 --> 00:14:02.160
think Jinbe would be THE PERFECT character to&nbsp;
use the Flame Flame fruit. That’s because with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:08.200
his natural water manipulation techniques plus&nbsp;
the power of the flame fruit, Jinbe could be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:16.520
a fire and water master the likes of which&nbsp;
the world has literally never seen before.

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:22.200
If you think Jinbe’s fighting style is unique&nbsp;
though just wait until we discuss the perfect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:30.520
devil fruit for this next character. Because now&nbsp;
we have Lucky Roux, who is one of Shanks’ top&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:37.680
officers, who we honestly haven’t seen fight too&nbsp;
much. He obviously used a gun back in chapter 1&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:45.560
and in Film Red we saw him bouncing around as this&nbsp;
giant spinning ball. So to find his perfect fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:51.680
is going to be quite tricky. Although we do know&nbsp;
he is always eating so maybe just giving him the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:57.920
Cook Cook fruit is the best choice. I mean, that&nbsp;
would let him turn anything into food and eat it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:03.760
so that sounds good to me. Another option&nbsp;
to enhance his bowling ball fighting style&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:09.520
is to give him the Ton Ton fruit, formerly&nbsp;
eaten by this guy, which allows the user to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:16.280
DRAMATICALLY increase their body’s weight.&nbsp;
I’m talking like up to 10 million Kilograms,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:23.440
which roughly equal to about 10,000 cars. So&nbsp;
yeah, just imagine Lucky Roux smashing into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:31.080
you with that kind of weight! You’d probably turn&nbsp;
into dust or something. However, this is Shanks’&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:37.840
crew we’re talking about, and I really feel like&nbsp;
we need something extra special here, so why not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:43.760
give Lucky Roux the Light Logia fruit because I&nbsp;
just literally can’t help myself from smiling at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:50.040
the image of Lucky Roux dashing around at the&nbsp;
speed of light. That kind of speed, plus all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:57.880
the other insane powers of that fruit might even&nbsp;
let Lucky Roux defeat this next character though.

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:06.080
Because while Lucky Roux is undoubtedly powerful,&nbsp;
Shanks' right hand man, Benn Beckman has an even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:12.440
more impressive reputation. He frightened an&nbsp;
admiral pre timeskip and is known to be both an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:19.880
expert marksman, brawler, and, most importantly,&nbsp;
he is one of the smartest characters in the entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:26.760
story. And that fact alone probably means&nbsp;
that Beckman could use nearly any devil fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:31.480
exceptionally well. Just some examples could&nbsp;
be the Book Book fruit that could let him trap&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:35.960
people in alternate dimensions, the Nine-Tailed&nbsp;
Fox fruit which would let him shape-shift into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:42.320
other people - which just has all kinds of uses&nbsp;
for an intelligent person - or even Law’s Ope&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:50.120
Ope no mi which is one of the most complicated&nbsp;
fruits to learn, but also has one of the highest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:58.800
potentials in the entire story. All of these would&nbsp;
be AMAZING choices for Shanks’ right hand man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:08.440
but there is ONE MORE FRUIT that truly fits&nbsp;
Beckman best. Ladies and Gentlemen, let me direct&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:15.880
you to the Magnet fruit. And man, this fruit&nbsp;
would be INSANE in Beckman’s hands. Clearly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:21.000
it is a tough fruit to use because it requires&nbsp;
such precise control and knowledge of machines,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:26.160
but in Beckman’s hands, he could&nbsp;
literally create ANYTHING out of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:32.200
metal. Railguns! An endless variety of weapons!&nbsp;
A battleship! Or if we’re really going crazy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:40.200
maybe even a giant mecha suit! Truly, this fruit&nbsp;
and Beckman would be a match made in heaven.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:54.720
But nothing, and I mean NOTHING, compares to the&nbsp;
PURE MAJESTY of what is coming next. Because now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:54.720 --> 00:18:08.160
we have the Red-Haired Captain himself, Shanks.&nbsp;
And we’re not even going to mess around with other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:16.680
options because there is only ONE FRUIT that&nbsp;
is ABSOLUTELY PERFECT for Shanks in my mind,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:23.840
and that is THIS! Just imagine how cool&nbsp;
it would be to have this ENORMOUS red&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:30.440
dragon flying over the battlefield. And&nbsp;
after fighting Kaido for most of Wano,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:38.560
we all know the awesome powers that this&nbsp;
Dragon form has, with its elemental lightning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:45.440
blast breath, wind slashes, and more, but eating&nbsp;
this fruit would also enhance Shanks' strength,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:54.880
speed, durability, and recovery. On top of that,&nbsp;
can you just imagine Shanks in his dragon-hybrid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:54.880 --> 00:19:03.400
